+    malformed/stale marker, and unlink it before the owner finishes writing.
+    Write and fsync a private file first, then hard-link that complete inode
+    into the authoritative name. ``link`` is atomic and refuses to replace an
+    existing owner on both NTFS and POSIX filesystems.
